{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_title", "source_sha256": "48dfd1a84b62cacc9caa115e9f1d0d31b4fe9d233d845c55be61875c8ff8f405", "ja": "憧れの舞台。だから…", "zh": "正因为是憧憬的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3a0c3c2bb67b7337a016f8109394e92c7b6e731d226c4d85284bb1e21496c6a", "ja": "次の公演のセンターに抜擢された静香。\n重圧に悩む彼女は、尊敬する千早にレッスン\nをみてもらうことに。本番に向けてのアドバ\nイスを受け、気負い過ぎていたことを受け入\nれた静香は、ステージを無事成功させる。", "zh": "静香被选为下次公演的Center。\n因身负重任而烦恼的她，在练习时得到她一直\n很尊敬的千早指点。静香接受了正式表演方面\n的建议，明白自己太求好心切之后，终于顺利\n完成表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "959e82ca32d1e682a0ab891d7d5872221553051903138f59b833514619b46b5a", "ja": "静香、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "静香，你现在有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "4aca30efec26390d7b5d7d3855ccf3287fe574e897eddc78bb85b1c7eae4260c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nあ、あの、話っていうのは……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n那、那个，是有什么事要跟我说……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8b3a8fbe363dbc2deef13dedd1de2ce2a8ee84d16711fa4a8cf7a3d5eedcaaf0", "ja": "実は……次の劇場公演で、\n静香にセンターをやってもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "其实……下次的剧场公演，\n我想让静香来担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "2d5ada594058219ab42e0042947a540fdc79791da421ef0907db31e3c0ac31ea", "ja": "！\nは……、はいっ！　わかりましたっ。", "zh": "！\n好……好的！我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "217ba3cbb15927ee22b37e693eb8389c1e702d33a7951323292bf5608a5a84c5", "ja": "私、先輩方に比べたら、まだまだですけど……\nせせ、精一杯、頑張りますっ！", "zh": "我的实力虽然还远远不及前辈们……\n但我会尽我所能，好好努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "978c57809fcb066f88a76fb00634906cf2818484a75a5bb8db1a519847c4e6c7", "ja": "はは、ちょっと肩に力が入り過ぎじゃないか？\nもう少し気楽に構えて……。", "zh": "哈哈，你太紧张了吧。\n稍微放轻松点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "0247cafa758ccbb0614d33199234db0464f02ab85a747bd17d486f2cdcf868e8", "ja": "そういうわけにいきません！\nだってセンターなんですよ！　重要なはずです！", "zh": "这怎么可以！\n现在说的可是Center喔！是很重要的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ec24b35bc4e641b37fada271aab3b0e0e2c997bcf6c8c8885eafd2e694019bb9", "ja": "それはそうなんだけど……。\nこの前、未来のセンターを見てたろ？", "zh": "话是这么说没错……\n但之前你也看过未来当Center的情形不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc862f186eb7b233ce466934c68dc3f95e787286ed5849145ec0eb9446fb5dd5", "ja": "あれは、未来だから許されたようなもので……。", "zh": "因为是未来，所以大家才觉得没关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "146ef0b20c4742a14b8f502e3d7bd3a7e6ee693c6c26a908f42e1df0204c0789", "ja": "えーっ！\n静香ちゃん、センターやるの！？", "zh": "咦──！\n小静，你要当Center！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "e44d265e00865ebc4aaab3e8a6cbb17ead1ea7638e5564dd1617fa1cf507f60b", "ja": "み、未来……。", "zh": "未、未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ac3139d741870d92266f237fc0d6fc40b6b3be717c32b74527a1202258b1c392", "ja": "いいなぁ～、未来も静香ちゃんも。\nわたしも、センターやりたいかも～。", "zh": "好好喔～未来和小静都有轮到。\n我也好当当看Center喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "cace7554f0282bfa2eb802d5ee5111bf93ba8ecd102b8d7c972615f95fcc780d", "ja": "そんな、翼なら、すぐに機会があるわよ。\n歌もダンスも、上手だし……。", "zh": "别这么说，翼很快就会有机会的。\n毕竟你唱歌和跳舞都很厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3865c233d6a0890a1823c3c878f36f979ee678d9d1568c88507ae03a38d79425", "ja": "だったらどうして、わたしじゃなくて\n未来や静香ちゃんがセンターなの～？", "zh": "那为什么都不选我，\n而是未来或小静来当Center呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "54e9d913aec00fe32584aee45e3384cc74f09e5428d97f6377dad582b249d04b", "ja": "えっ！？\nそ、それは……そうね、どうしてかしら……？", "zh": "咦！？\n这、这个……是啊，为什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "39b17183ebbc3da3b2260b5969aa8d169896a147cf11e7ef7f3a17ab53154933", "ja": "（確かに実力だけで言えば、翼はセンターでも\nおかしくないだろう……けど……）", "zh": "（确实，光就实力而言，\n由翼来担任Center也不足为奇……不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "de7c7750a8d6e89b506f252214039b8c1fbd832b85c37ff79dfd4ac96bc81196", "ja": "ふぅ～。今日もたくさん練習しました！\n少しは、上手になったかな……？", "zh": "呼～今天也做了好多练习！\n应该有比较进步吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "060200106f140e5b9d8913d083814d1fc526147498c3a7bb0d2dffadd18f8e2f", "ja": "あっ、星梨花だ！", "zh": "啊，是星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ca91053648d10e44514cf6796940e2d776ef76e9ad0824ca2a6acb8dfcd1d9a7", "ja": "あっ、ホントだ～。\nわたし、呼んでくるね！", "zh": "啊，真的耶～\n我去叫她过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "3c9d93e7e5ab85622ac34c6b6e03d9094e266e7e0d2834dd11ee1dd10fcbc1c8", "ja": "えっ！？\nあ、ちょっと、翼……！", "zh": "咦！？\n啊，等一下，翼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c01aa5bf0ee721a0a04af313ac79a368cbfb9c62fb8d01482ccb3289ea8f24c", "ja": "こんにちは、翼さん！\n未来さん、静香さんも！", "zh": "翼姊姊，你好！\n未来姊姊、静香姊姊你们好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "41f858d24c1be774c8a4b9b7a4ae9932e979f6798cc9ded1b3bcee1da27f4c34", "ja": "それに、{$P$}さんも……。\nみなさんお揃いで、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "还有{$P$}先生也在……\n大家都聚在这边，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a10d3d27248a78091d5a888b4bdf67648136bd8ae31860ce8adb81db29e4aed2", "ja": "ああ、実は……。", "zh": "嗯，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "53a06a2bd894a124ee0323ca0f7b9344a95b0e6b375720c4fbacf37412530944", "ja": "星梨花、聞いて聞いて！　あのね、今度の公演、\n静香ちゃんがセンターになるんだって！", "zh": "星梨花，听我说、听我说！\n就是啊，下次的公演要由小静来当Center喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "5677620498a91c225b9a5d476acdc84d7c342704010cbefc142b092950831285", "ja": "わぁ……！\n静香さん、センターになるんですか！？", "zh": "哇……！\n静香姊姊要当Center吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "b10ceef8cf5364e4fe1aa16c0686d9881b5e9f040029cbb80c93389ad7cbae05", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと未来……。", "zh": "等、等等，未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "b8fd62f4f367f0c9f170a275dd051cccdd67f623c1e806cb52ff7949a79feab3", "ja": "センターって、すごいことなんですよね？\n静香さん、頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "能够当Center很厉害对不对？\n静香姊姊，你要加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "c69f9bed4fef3f13423c978b6e1def394322fdfab2fbbfecc561220b531df1a9", "ja": "え、ええ。\nもちろんよ。", "zh": "是、是啊。\n这当然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "b5937b8fa56b51043eafc1bd20486ff720e0f4181e446307f5685ad96ca11fcb", "ja": "せっかく、選ばれたんだもの……\n恥ずかしくないステージにしなくちゃ。", "zh": "好不容易被选上了……\n我一定要完成不令剧场蒙羞的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1029_p", "source_sha256": "45702d5e3b267c30dd008ea4005ffc4d62f8fec2f802df740ea45e731df683e8", "ja": "（静香……）", "zh": "（静香……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "adb74bfcf2dd435b90253dac412e099eedb1a3d11cf6e2858aa6029a49cb571d", "ja": "静香ちゃんが次のセンターか～。\nじゃあ、その次は……星梨花かも～？", "zh": "小静是下次的Center啊～\n那再下一次……说不定会是星梨花～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "d371878b57cbe9d19af3773c1c908c23659786f62e691f1bc247ed915e8b0889", "ja": "ええっ！？　わ、わたしは、ちょっと……\nまだ、無理だと思います……。", "zh": "咦咦！？我、我应该……\n还没办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a3e418a4638b549336ce093f5f99f409dd40e4c72c62ebf0940d082840101c1d", "ja": "え～、みんなセンターとかズルいよ～。ねぇねぇ、\n{$P$}さん！　わたしは～？", "zh": "咦～大家都可以当Center，不公平～\n欸欸，{$P$}先生！那我呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1033_p", "source_sha256": "64db61854079a8efd47f00e87fb06b143ed33c972780628abdb69f741ca7b451", "ja": "まぁまぁ。\nセンターは、ひとりだからセンターなんだよ。", "zh": "好了好了，Center一次只有一个人，\n所以才叫Center啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "95d8bfabc9b86a4e796f0680645146a101e8e5636e98452e6ce367a7ff54e53e", "ja": "……。\nセンターは……ひとりだから、センター……。", "zh": "……Center……\n只有一个人，所以才是Center……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "75351e1aa85215a4e8d13c459d39b62c16274005ee0cebf187129bec16fe10d7", "ja": "はあ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_002_1036_p", "source_sha256": "5a1917cef8e1cfed593a62768636ecaa788e4fa53ef3b2e149d76999ea743502", "ja": "（静香……？）", "zh": "（静香……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
